exports[`NotificationsPanel states > LINE available but not linked 1`] = `"<section class="surface-card p-4 sm:p-5"><h2 class="font-semibold text-[18px] text-[var(--text)]">通知</h2><p class="mt-1 text-[13px] text-[var(--text-muted)] leading-relaxed">管理通知管道與安靜時段。</p><div class="mt-4 divide-y divide-[var(--border)]"><div class="pb-4"><p class="mb-2 text-[13px] text-[var(--text-muted)]">通知管道</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3"><label class="flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 text-[14px] text-[var(--text)] cursor-not-allowed opacity-50"><input disabled="" class="size-4 rounded border-[var(--border)] accent-[var(--accent)] !outline-none focus-visible:rounded-[3px] focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[var(--accent)] focus-visible:ring-offset-1" type="checkbox" checked="">站內通知</label><label class="flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 text-[14px] text-[var(--text)]"><input class="size-4 rounded border-[var(--border)] accent-[var(--accent)] !outline-none focus-visible:rounded-[3px] focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[var(--accent)] focus-visible:ring-offset-1" type="checkbox">LINE（尚未連結）</label><label class="flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 text-[14px] text-[var(--text)]"><input class="size-4 rounded border-[var(--border)] accent-[var(--accent)] !outline-none focus-visible:rounded-[3px] focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[var(--accent)] focus-visible:ring-offset-1" type="checkbox">Telegram（尚未連結）</label><label class="flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 text-[14px] text-[var(--text)]"><input class="size-4 rounded border-[var(--border)] accent-[var(--accent)] !outline-none focus-visible:rounded-[3px] focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[var(--accent)] focus-visible:ring-offset-1" type="checkbox" checked="">電子郵件</label><label class="flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 text-[14px] text-[var(--text)]"><input class="size-4 rounded border-[var(--border)] accent-[var(--accent)] !outline-none focus-visible:rounded-[3px] focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[var(--accent)] focus-visible:ring-offset-1" type="checkbox">瀏覽器通知（尚未設定）</label></div><p class="mt-2 text-[12px] text-[var(--text-muted)]">站內通知一律開啟，也是你的通知匣。其他管道需要能聯絡到你才會送達：帳號 Email、已註冊的裝置、LINE 登入，或已連結的 Telegram 聊天室。</p><div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-[13px]"><span class="text-[var(--text-muted)]">此裝置的瀏覽器通知：</span><span class="text-[var(--text-muted)]">伺服器尚未設定。</span></div><div class="mt-3 space-y-1 text-[13px]"><button type="button" class="text-[var(--accent)] underline">連結 LINE</button></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 py-4 first:pt-0 last:pb-0 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:gap-4"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="font-medium text-[14px] text-[var(--text)]">安靜時段</p></div><div class="shrink-0"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-end gap-3"><button type="button" role="switch" aria-checked="true" aria-label="安靜時段" class="inline-flex min-h-11 min-w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center !outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[var(--accent)] disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50"><span class="relative inline-flex h-6 w-11 items-center rounded-[var(--radius-pill)] transition-colors bg-[var(--accent)]"><span class="inline-block size-5 translate-x-0.5 rounded-full bg-[var(--bg)] transition-transform translate-x-[22px]"></span></span></button><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><input class="min-h-11 w-full rounded-[var(--radius-input)] border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--surface)] px-3 text-[14px] text-[var(--text)] placeholder:text-[var(--text-muted)] !outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[var(--accent)] w-28" aria-label="開始時間" type="time" value="22:00"><span class="text-[var(--text-muted)]">–</span><input class="min-h-11 w-full rounded-[var(--radius-input)] border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--surface)] px-3 text-[14px] text-[var(--text)] placeholder:text-[var(--text-muted)] !outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[var(--accent)] w-28" aria-label="結束時間" type="time" value="06:00"></div></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 py-4 first:pt-0 last:pb-0 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:gap-4"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="font-medium text-[14px] text-[var(--text)]">時區</p></div><div class="shrink-0"><div class="w-72 max-w-full"><button type="button" data-tz="Asia/Taipei">tz</button></div></div></div><p class="pb-3 text-[12px] text-[var(--text-muted)]">靜音時段內的通知仍會安靜地放進通知匣；其他管道會在靜音結束時合併成一則摘要送出。</p><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 py-4 first:pt-0 last:pb-0 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:gap-4"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="font-medium text-[14px] text-[var(--text)]">晨間摘要</p></div><div class="shrink-0"><button type="button" role="switch" aria-checked="true" aria-label="晨間摘要" class="inline-flex min-h-11 min-w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center !outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[var(--accent)] disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50"><span class="relative inline-flex h-6 w-11 items-center rounded-[var(--radius-pill)] transition-colors bg-[var(--accent)]"><span class="inline-block size-5 translate-x-0.5 rounded-full bg-[var(--bg)] transition-transform translate-x-[22px]"></span></span></button></div></div><p class="pb-3 text-[12px] text-[var(--text-muted)]">每個台股交易日 08:00 起（依你的時區，並等安靜時段結束）送出完整晨間報告：美股隔夜、總經、加權指數、三大法人、類股、今日行事曆，以及你自選股的個股與 ETF，累積在同一個對話中。不會消耗對話額度；資料無法取得時改送簡短回顧。</p></div></section>"`;

